WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.591
Who taught the model what belongs together?

00:00:32.591 --> 00:01:10.999
Clicks and answers teach different lessons

00:01:10.999 --> 00:01:44.599
A citation supplies a scholarly relationship

00:01:44.599 --> 00:02:20.072
The same architecture can receive a different education

00:02:20.072 --> 00:03:02.688
A small difference can carry the whole need

00:03:02.688 --> 00:03:40.376
Poor results do not identify the cause

00:03:40.376 --> 00:04:20.233
Ask what is stored, what taught it, and what works
